  "solution": {
    "text": "Normal vector to the plane <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Equation of the plane through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is<br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the distance from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units"
  }
